<h2>8. Unified probability workbench</h2>
<p class="section-intro">Choose the model and the probability wording. The workbench highlights the relevant region, reports the calculation method, and translates the result into operational language.</p>
<div class="interactive-shell">
<div class="compact-controls">
<div class="control"><label for="wbModel">Model</label><select id="wbModel"><option value="binomial">Binomial</option><option value="poisson">Poisson</option><option value="exponential">Exponential</option></select></div>
